---
title: The implement workflow of GETTING_STARTED.md, as priory draw and Flows show it
---
flowchart TD
  %% The SVG draws open-pr as an octagon with a padlock, a model's edges dashed, a person's thick and solid, and code's thin and dashed, as Flows does.
  implement["implement: model step"]
  approve[/"approve-pr: human step"/]
  open{{"open-pr: code step, irreversible, runs only after a person approved it"}}
  done(["done"])
  stop(["stop"])
  implement -. "passed (a model decides)" .-> approve
  implement -. "failed (a model decides)" .-> stop
  approve == "open (a person decides)" ==> open
  approve == "stop (a person decides)" ==> stop
  open -- "opened (code decides)" --> done
  open -- "failed (code decides)" --> stop
